/E (About half \(51%\) of the household population in Nigeria has access to electricity and nearly all \(98%\) of the household population uses clean fuels or technologies for lighting, such as electricity, solar lanterns, rechargeable flashlights/torches/lanterns, battery powered flashlights/torches/lanterns, and biogas lamps.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [3]
>>
